---
const eras = [
  {
    key: 'then',
    kicker: 'The old shape',
    title: 'The team was the silo',
    unitLabel: 'Owning team',
    units: 4,
    ledger: [
      { term: 'Budget line', value: 'One, visible' },
      { term: 'Maintainer', value: 'A named team' },
      { term: 'When it works', value: 'Ships to everyone behind it' },
      { term: 'When they leave', value: 'You know who to ask' },
    ],
    verdict: 'Slow to move, but the work accumulated somewhere.',
  },
  {
    key: 'now',
    kicker: 'The new shape',
    title: 'The person is the silo',
    unitLabel: 'Every employee',
    units: 16,
    ledger: [
      { term: 'Budget line', value: 'Tokens, spread thin' },
      { term: 'Maintainer', value: 'Whoever built it' },
      { term: 'When it works', value: 'Stays in one chat history' },
      { term: 'When they leave', value: 'It leaves with them' },
    ],
    verdict: 'Fast to move, and nothing compounds.',
  },
];
---

<figure
  class="ts-figure"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Two organizational shapes compared. Previously the owning team was the silo: one visible budget line, a named maintainer team, work that shipped to everyone behind it, and a known owner when someone left. Now the individual employee is the silo: token spend spread thin, whoever built it maintains it, successful work stays in one chat history, and the solution leaves when the person does."
>
  <header class="ts-header">
    <span class="ts-eyebrow">What giving everyone tokens actually changed</span>
    <h3>We did not remove the silos. We made one per person.</h3>
  </header>

  <div class="ts-compare">
    {eras.map((era) => (
      <section class={`ts-era ts-era--${era.key}`}>
        <span class="ts-kicker">{era.kicker}</span>
        <h4>{era.title}</h4>

        <div class="ts-field" aria-hidden="true">
          {Array.from({ length: era.units }).map(() => (
            <span class="ts-unit"></span>
          ))}
        </div>
        <span class="ts-unit-label" aria-hidden="true">{era.unitLabel}</span>

        <dl class="ts-ledger">
          {era.ledger.map((row) => (
            <div class="ts-row">
              <dt>{row.term}</dt>
              <dd>{row.value}</dd>
            </div>
          ))}
        </dl>

        <p class="ts-verdict">{era.verdict}</p>
      </section>
    ))}
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    The plumbing did not change. The CRM, the dashboards, and the ticketing system are
    still the pipes the business runs through. What changed is that avoidance of that
    plumbing is now a per-seat expense with no path back to the organization.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ts-figure {
    margin: 3rem 0;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(19, 34, 53, 0.14);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fbfaf6 0%, #f4f1ea 100%);
  }

  .ts-header {
    margin-bottom: 1.9rem;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .ts-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #008fd3;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .ts-header h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.34rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #132235;
  }

  .ts-compare {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.4rem;
  }

  .ts-era {
    position: relative;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.35rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(19, 34, 53, 0.12);
    background: #fbfaf6;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ts-era--now {
    background: linear-gradient(165deg, #0a2130 0%, #143247 100%);
    border-color: rgba(52, 186, 255, 0.32);
  }

  .ts-kicker {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(19, 34, 53, 0.55);
  }

  .ts-era--now .ts-kicker {
    color: #34baff;
  }

  .ts-era h4 {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.32;
    color: #132235;
  }

  .ts-era--now h4 {
    color: #fbfaf6;
  }

  .ts-field {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.42rem;
    min-height: 3.6rem;
    align-content: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .ts-unit {
    width: 1.45rem;
    height: 1.45rem;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: rgba(0, 143, 211, 0.16);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 143, 211, 0.45);
  }

  .ts-era--now .ts-unit {
    width: 0.72rem;
    height: 0.72rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.2);
    border-color: rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.6);
  }

  .ts-unit-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(19, 34, 53, 0.5);
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
  }

  .ts-era--now .ts-unit-label {
    color: rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.6);
  }

  .ts-ledger {
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.05rem;
  }

  .ts-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 8.5rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(19, 34, 53, 0.1);
  }

  .ts-era--now .ts-row {
    border-top-color: rgba(165, 184, 238, 0.22);
  }

  .ts-row dt {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.79rem;
    color: rgba(19, 34, 53, 0.62);
  }

  .ts-era--now .ts-row dt {
    color: rgba(165, 184, 238, 0.85);
  }

  .ts-row dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #132235;
  }

  .ts-era--now .ts-row dd {
    color: #fbfaf6;
  }

  .ts-verdict {
    margin: auto 0 0;
    padding-top: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(19, 34, 53, 0.7);
    border-top: 2px solid rgba(0, 143, 211, 0.35);
  }

  .ts-era--now .ts-verdict {
    color: #f4c430;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-top-color: rgba(244, 196, 48, 0.5);
  }

  .ts-figure figcaption {
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
    padding-top: 1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(19, 34, 53, 0.12);
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(19, 34, 53, 0.72);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .ts-figure {
      padding: 1.4rem 1.15rem;
    }

    .ts-compare {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ts-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7.5rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
